{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Knight Crawler",
    "steam_appid": 3822820,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822820/extras/2cc71ad70691a8aaf01bff39789dc67d.avif?t=1752692535\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of Cyrus, a medieval knight trapped in an endless dungeon.<i> Knight Crawler</i>\u00a0is a top-down action roguelike where each run is unpredictable, unforgiving, and ruthless. Explore procedurally generated rooms (or depth) that change with every playthrough</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room entered poses a new challenge, whether that be a new enemy, an enhanced previous enemy, or an increased number of enemies. As you dive deeper, you face foes ranging from a little rat to an uncontrollable wizard shooting flurries of fireballs. The challenge isn't just to survive, but to adapt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, you will encounter health potions, weapons, shops, and blacksmiths. Collect coins to purchase and upgrade your weapons. Weapons can have up to 6 modifiers, ranging from simple damage boosts to lightning, lifesteal, and legendaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music and Sound: <strong>Lev Strider</strong><br>Enemy Artwork: <strong>Olivia Sofranko</strong> (IG: @oliviasofr)<br>Main Character Design: <strong>Cooper Green</strong><br>All other aspects (programming, environment, design, etc.):<strong> Taylor Conolley</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822820/extras/2cc71ad70691a8aaf01bff39789dc67d.avif?t=1752692535\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of Cyrus, a medieval knight trapped in an endless dungeon.<i> Knight Crawler</i>\u00a0is a top-down action roguelike where each run is unpredictable, unforgiving, and ruthless. Explore procedurally generated rooms (or depth) that change with every playthrough</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room entered poses a new challenge, whether that be a new enemy, an enhanced previous enemy, or an increased number of enemies. As you dive deeper, you face foes ranging from a little rat to an uncontrollable wizard shooting flurries of fireballs. The challenge isn't just to survive, but to adapt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, you will encounter health potions, weapons, shops, and blacksmiths. Collect coins to purchase and upgrade your weapons. Weapons can have up to 6 modifiers, ranging from simple damage boosts to lightning, lifesteal, and legendaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music and Sound: <strong>Lev Strider</strong><br>Enemy Artwork: <strong>Olivia Sofranko</strong> (IG: @oliviasofr)<br>Main Character Design: <strong>Cooper Green</strong><br>All other aspects (programming, environment, design, etc.):<strong> Taylor Conolley</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Play as Cyrus, a medieval knight, in this top-down action roguelike. Battle your way through endless procedurally generated dungeons filled with coins and weapons. Discover rare, powerful modifiers and test your skills against a variety of deadly foes.",
